Grammar

    0 $accept: TPTP_file $end

    1 TPTP_file: %empty
    2          | TPTP_file TPTP_input

    3 TPTP_input: annotated_formula
    4           | include

    5 annotated_formula: thf_annotated
    6                  | tff_annotated
    7                  | tcf_annotated
    8                  | fof_annotated
    9                  | cnf_annotated
   10                  | tpi_annotated

   11 tpi_annotated: _LIT_tpi LPAREN name COMMA formula_role COMMA tpi_formula annotations RPAREN PERIOD

   12 tpi_formula: fof_formula

   13 thf_annotated: _LIT_thf LPAREN name COMMA formula_role COMMA thf_formula annotations RPAREN PERIOD

   14 tff_annotated: _LIT_tff LPAREN name COMMA formula_role COMMA tff_formula annotations RPAREN PERIOD

